  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook udon noodles over medium-high heat, gently stirring with a fork to separate, until tender, 1-2 minutes.\n• Drain, rinse and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80f9b511ee4a266ae2a1/step-158f6200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Cut Japanese tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80f9b511ee4a266ae2a1/step-46937110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook sliced mushrooms and carrot, until just softened, 2 minutes.\n• Cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes. Add sweet soy seasoning and cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add cooked udon noodles, baby spinach leaves, oyster sauce, the brown sugar and water, tossing until well combined, 1 minute. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80f9b511ee4a266ae2a1/step-7f7b8e20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide tofu udon noodle stir-fry between bowls. Top with plant-based kimchi. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80f9b511ee4a266ae2a1/step-ea280f30.jpg"
    }
  ]
